    "head_branch": "feature/unit-store-sync-reads-store",
    "head_commit_message": "feat(formation): the field's sync reads how each unit stands from the store\n\nSpec 35 step 4e. BodyField.sync takes the roster (each squad's living\nunits in list order) and a mode, the scrum's or the bodies' snapshot,\ninstead of each unit's flags, next point and bearing. The field reads\nhow each unit stands from the store's flag bits, a loose unit's next\npoint and each bearing from the columns. Since 2a a unit's bit is set\nexactly while its own squad holds the entry, so the bits say what the\nentries said. A fleeing unit's point on its route stays GDScript's.\nThis completes step 4.\n\nTests: test_body_field.gd syncs with only the roster (red on the 4d\nlibrary); field.rs and blows.rs set the bits in the store first.\n\nWaived-by: Decision 142\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YWpV2AHWr3d2v4fKRki8G7",
